    "Peck DT, Seeley TD (2019): Mite bombs or robber lures? PLoS ONE 14(6): e0218392. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0218392\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Link</a>",
